  "four_layer_theorem": {
    "i_recognized_grammar": "C_FG is a theorem-ready surface-free input class: exact arithmetic recovers polar/chord, grid/projectivity, Mobius S(3,4,10), Desargues triangle/cut, or the tetrahedral 4+6 five-frame design from arbitrary normalized coordinates and arbitrary wall order.",
