    "iii_exact_same_P_return": "For the independently checked intersection C_FG cap D_CobVin, the existing Vinberg finite-index, complete primitive-cusp lift, finite-volume, and hidden-wall theorem upgrades the root seed to a full-nef carrier and returns literally the same oriented P. Core recognition alone does not assert this intersection.",
    "iv_Kondo_pushback": "After that same-P carrier exists, Kondo classification applies independently. On the present five-core class it recovers only the already encoded dimensions 10, 11, 14, and 17 and gives no new abstract example or sharper global bound."
